# Drift Detection Suppressions — Baseline 2026-04-03
# Format: check_name:rule_type:value
#
# Pre-existing drift documented during initial baseline.
# Each section explains why the findings are acceptable.
# New drift should NOT be added here without review.

# ============================================================================
# ENUM SYNC: SIP2CommandType uses numeric values ("23", "11") — not
# uppercase/lowercase, but drift check flags them. Safe to suppress.
# ============================================================================
enum_sync:ignore_type:sip2commandtype

